            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/latest-primaries-yield-mixed-results-for-moderate-and-progressive-democrats</link>
            <description><![CDATA[We're getting a clearer picture of who will be on the midterm ballots and the direction of the political parties after key primary races were decided in six states. Midwestern voters weighed in on party establishment candidates, insurgencies and a pair of celebrities. In the Southeast, questions surrounding political succession and Trump's influence remain unresolved. William Brangham reports.]]></description>
